# Deployment-readiness hardening: the PUBLIC TEST self-service image must
# never contain the repository's own ledger, checkpoints, or any operator
# secret material. This list is reviewed alongside Dockerfile and
# spec/public-test-self-service-deployment.md's "what enters the image"
# section — treat any change here as security-relevant.

.git
node_modules
dist
public

# The historical production ledger and its evidence trail. Never needed
# inside the TEST runtime image — the TEST deployment mode is configured to
# use a dedicated volume-mounted ledger instead (TII_LEDGER=/data/ledger/ledger.jsonl).
data
checkpoints

# Never committed in the first place (see .gitignore), but excluded here
# too as defense-in-depth against a local, uncommitted copy being present
# on the build machine.
*.private.pem
*.lock
*.journal
.env
.env.*

test
spec
*.md
.vercel
vercel.json
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
